<header><p class="enc-kicker">Religion / idea · concept</p><h1 class="enc-title">Millenarianism</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as millenarian</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Millenarianism is the belief in a coming transformation of the world that will bring about a new age of justice and salvation. Millenarian movements often inspired popular uprisings in times of crisis. In the late <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/han-dynasty">Han Dynasty</a>, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yellow-turban-rebellion">Yellow Turban Rebellion</a> of 184 CE was a millenarian Taoist uprising that seriously weakened the dynasty.</p></div>
